# LogView language catalog (English)
#
# Format: <key>=<value>
#   - One entry per line, split on the FIRST '='.
#   - Lines starting with '#' and empty lines are ignored.
#   - Keys are semantic identifiers (e.g. "menu.file"); whitespace around the
#     key is ignored.
#   - Use '\n' to embed a newline in a value.
#   - Placeholders %1, %2, ... are substituted at runtime.
#   - The file must be saved as UTF-8.

